OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners consider legal action
OL,4,Aover new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners are considering legal
OL,7,Faction after plans for 54 homes on
OL,8,Fgreen belt land were approved.
OL,10,FThurrock Council's planning committee
OL,11,Fvoted in favour of the development off
OL,12,FBlackshots Lane in Grays, Essex, on 13
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FPlanning officers argued the site would
OL,16,Ftackle housing shortages and met new
OL,17,Fnational rules relating to grey belt
OL,18,Fland - areas of green belt land the
OL,19,Fgovernment once described as "poor
OL,20,Fquality and ugly".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
