OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners consider legal action
OL,4,Aover new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition opposing the development
OL,7,Fattracted 1,400 signatures and the
OL,8,FThurrock Residents Association and
OL,9,FBlackshots Residents Objection Group
OL,10,Fsay they might seek a judicial review.
